{"id":"00296","root":"uni00296_1","name":{"ja":"ミリアム","en":"Merriam"},"title":{"ja":"【ＶＤラッピング】","en":"【VD Wrapping】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【ＶＤラッピング】 ミリアム","en":"【VD Wrapping】 Merriam"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Magic"],"release":"2020-02-13","limited":true,"characterId":64,"profile":{"ja":"絶大な魔力を持つ魔女だったが、対魔忍に敗北して魔力を封印された。その影響で身体も小さくなってしまい、長らくその身体で生活している。封印されているといっても低級な魔族なら軽く葬り去る程度の魔力は持っていて、攻撃する際は使い魔に魔力を込めて放つ。体格にあわせて性格も幼げになってしまっているが、言葉遣いは尊大。本人は元の身体に戻りたいのだが、封印を解く方法がわからず、若干諦めも入りつつある。別種族から命を狙われることを避けるため、本名は名乗っていない。人間界で活動する以上ある程度なじんでおく必要があると、人間の風習を学んでいた彼女はバレンタインというものの存在を知る。早速知り合いに尋ね、バレンタインなるものについて知識を得たが、尋ねた相手が悪かったか解釈が悪かったか、イマイチ理解に齟齬がある様子。","en":"Merriam was once a witch of immense magical power, but after being defeated by a Taimanin she had her magic sealed. The sealing shrank her body, and she has lived in this diminished form ever since. Though her magic is sealed, she still possesses enough power to imbue her familiars with spells for attacks. Her reduced stature has also made her personality seem childlike, yet she speaks with an arrogant tone. She longs to regain her original body but lacks any knowledge of how to break the seal, and a hint of resignation has begun to set in. To avoid being targeted by other species, she does not reveal her true name. Since she operates in the Human Realm, she's learned that she must blend in to some extent; studying human customs, she discovered the concept of Valentine's Day. She promptly asked an acquaintance about it, but either the source or her interpretation was off, leaving her with a vague, confused understanding."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"姫川あいり","forms":[{"id":"uni00296_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1108,2216],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[134,268],"def":[108,216],"spd":[61,61],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["3","480007"]},{"id":"uni00296_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1716,3432],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[203,406],"def":[151,302],"spd":[61,61],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["3","480007","480008"]},{"id":"uni00296_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2324,4642],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[277,555],"def":[199,399],"spd":[61,61],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["3","480007","480008"]}],"skills":{"3":{"slot":"attack","id":3,"name":null,"hits":5,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Spiritual damage"}]},"480007":{"slot":"skill1","id":480007,"name":{"ja":"しろ＆くろアタック"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体を超高確率で火傷状態にする"}},{"level":2,"sp":155,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体を超高確率で火傷状態にする"}},{"level":3,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体を超高確率で火傷状態にする"}},{"level":4,"sp":145,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体を超高確率で火傷状態にする"}},{"level":5,"sp":140,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体を超高確率で火傷状態にする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 80% chance to inflict Burn for 3 turns","icon":"burn"}]},"480008":{"slot":"skill2","id":480008,"name":{"ja":"ホットしろくろ！"},"hits":2,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵２体に小威力で攻撃、超高確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":2,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵２体に小威力で攻撃、超高確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":3,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵２体に小威力で攻撃、超高確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":4,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵２体に小威力で攻撃、超高確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":5,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵２体に小威力で攻撃、超高確率で麻痺状態にする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"2 enemies: 210% Spiritual damage"},{"text":"2 enemies: 70% chance to inflict Paralysis for 2 turns","icon":"paralysis"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"スイートプリティ"},"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ユニットのATKを大アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"Spiritual allies: ATK +20%","icon":"atk_up"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":1,"gold":1,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00002",80],[1,"blo00005",1],[2,"blo00007",15],[3,"blo00010",15],[4,"blo00013",15],[5,"blo00007",15],[6,"blo00010",15],[7,"blo00013",15],[8,"blo00007",15],[9,"blo00010",10],[9,"blo00011",10],[10,"blo00007",10],[10,"blo00008",10],[11,"blo00013",10],[11,"blo00014",10],[12,"blo00002",160],[12,"blo00005",2],[13,"blo00007",10],[13,"blo00008",10],[14,"blo00010",10],[14,"blo00011",10],[15,"blo00013",10],[15,"blo00014",10],[16,"blo00007",10],[16,"blo00008",10],[17,"blo00010",10],[17,"blo00011",10],[18,"blo00013",10],[18,"blo00014",10],[19,"blo00007",10],[19,"blo00008",10],[20,"blo00010",5],[20,"blo00011",15],[20,"blo00012",5],[21,"blo00007",5],[21,"blo00008",15],[21,"blo00009",5],[22,"blo00013",5],[22,"blo00014",15],[22,"blo00015",5],[23,"blo00010",5],[23,"blo00011",15],[23,"blo00012",5],[24,"blo00007",5],[24,"blo00008",15],[24,"blo00009",5],[25,"blo00013",5],[25,"blo00014",15],[25,"blo00015",5],[26,"blo00002",80],[26,"blo00005",1],[27,"blo00008",3],[27,"blo00011",3],[27,"blo00014",3],[28,"blo00008",3],[28,"blo00011",3],[28,"blo00014",3],[29,"blo00008",3],[29,"blo00011",3],[29,"blo00014",3],[30,"blo00008",3],[30,"blo00011",3],[30,"blo00014",3],[31,"blo00002",160],[31,"blo00005",2],[32,"blo00008",3],[32,"blo00011",3],[32,"blo00014",3],[33,"blo00008",3],[33,"blo00011",3],[33,"blo00014",3],[34,"blo00008",3],[34,"blo00011",3],[34,"blo00014",3],[35,"blo00008",3],[35,"blo00011",3],[35,"blo00014",3],[36,"blo00002",160],[36,"blo00005",2],[37,"blo00008",3],[37,"blo00011",3],[37,"blo00014",3],[38,"blo00008",3],[38,"blo00011",3],[38,"blo00014",3],[39,"blo00008",3],[39,"blo00011",3],[39,"blo00014",3],[40,"blo00008",3],[40,"blo00011",3],[40,"blo00014",3],[41,"blo00002",160],[41,"blo00005",2],[42,"blo00008",3],[42,"blo00011",3],[42,"blo00014",3],[43,"blo00008",3],[43,"blo00011",3],[43,"blo00014",3],[44,"blo00008",3],[44,"blo00011",3],[44,"blo00014",3],[45,"blo00008",3],[45,"blo00011",3],[45,"blo00014",3],[46,"blo00002",160],[46,"blo00005",2],[47,"blo00008",3],[47,"blo00009",1],[47,"blo00011",3],[47,"blo00012",1],[47,"blo00014",3],[47,"blo00015",1],[48,"blo00008",3],[48,"blo00009",1],[48,"blo00011",3],[48,"blo00012",1],[48,"blo00014",3],[48,"blo00015",1],[49,"blo00008",3],[49,"blo00009",1],[49,"blo00011",3],[49,"blo00012",1],[49,"blo00014",3],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00008",3],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00011",3],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00014",3],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"なんだ、しょぼくれた顔をしおって……こんなちんまい菓子一つに、必死だな。ほれ、ありがたく受け取れ","en":"What, making that pathetic face… you're desperate over a tiny little candy. Here, take it gratefully."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"なるほど……なぜチョコなのかはわからんが、なかなか興味深い風習だな","en":"I see… I don't get why it's chocolate, but it's a rather interesting custom."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"世話になった相手にも渡すのか……よしよし、そうまで言うならもらってやろう♪　ほれ、遠慮せずチョコをよこすといい","en":"You even give it to someone who helped you… alright, if you say so I'll take it♪ Here, don't hold back and hand over the chocolate."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"なんだ、誰にもチョコをもらえなかったのか？　仕方のないやつだ……ほれ、日頃の礼だ。これからも、よろしく頼むぞ","en":"What, you didn't get any chocolate from anyone? What a pitiful thing… here, a token of my daily gratitude. From now on, I expect your continued cooperation."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"……この格好か？　人間界のことを教えてくれるやつに、男にチョコを渡すならこれを着ていけ、と勧められてな","en":"…this outfit? Someone who teaches me about the Human Realm suggested I wear this if I were to give chocolate to a man."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"ヒラヒラして、ちょっと薄着だが……なに、カワイイ？　なんか、バカにされとるようだが……まぁ、似合ってるならいいか","en":"It's fluttery and a bit skimpy… what, cute? Feels like I'm being made a fool of… well, if it suits me, fine."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"は、はっぴ～、ばれんたい～ん♪　チョコの代わりに自分を渡すのが、最近のトレンドだと聞いたぞ？","en":"Ha, happy~, unstoppable~♪ I heard the latest trend is giving yourself instead of chocolate, huh?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"なるほど、これとこれと、この薬を……なに？　見てわからんか、チョコレートを作っているところだ","en":"I see, this and that, and this potion… what? Can't tell by looking, I'm making chocolate."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00296_1/uni00296_1_wav_1.ogg"}],"trust":[100],"scenes":[["chr_0196_r18"]],"stills":[["chr_0196a_r18"]],"obtain":[{"kind":"gacha","type":"Limited","title":{"ja":"【復刻】期間限定バレンタインガチャ"},"start":"2026-02-10","end":"2026-02-25"},{"kind":"spark","title":null,"need":100,"start":null,"end":null}],"standardPool":false,"art":{"graphicId":"uni_00296","graphicNum":2,"r18GraphicId":"uni_00296_r18","r18GraphicNum":2,"spineId":"Chr_0197"}}